<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLSubjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    Subject Map must generate a resource representing the subject of\n    an RDF triple.\n    " .
_:n1db318a48f2b499690ab86d9e733043ab1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/termType> .
_:n6da6b630f3124f9899511867ce75bcf7b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A shortcut on an Expression Map: its value must be a\n        boolean-returning function-valued expression map. If the\n        condition evaluates to true, the enclosing Expression Map's own\n        value is used.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLChildMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    rml:ChildMap must specify a literal referencing data in the child data\n    source.\n    " .
